    narr:narration """This narrative holds two positions. The hub's founding move is [defining the product against real-time chat as the named anti-pattern](narr:Position_AntiPatternRealtimeChat), stated when the narrative was first dated. Twelve days later a supporting position arrived: [the next sprint centers on context preservation — linking decisions to the threads that produced them](narr:Position_ContextPreservationNextSprint), which the same child frames as [the #1 request from beta users](narr:Position_ContextPreservationNextSprint). The arc runs from negative definition (what the product is not) toward a concrete build priority drawn from user demand; nothing here records where that priority landed.""" ;
